{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f52163d9-be15-8c86-9ed8-84a20426437d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:55:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water and Sewer billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:53:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Priya. Well, it's either you or the bank, and the bank's already lost. I'm calling about my water bill. My payment bounced and nobody told me anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:53:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Can I get your name and the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:53:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonella Iannuccilli, 116 Narragansett Avenue. Fifth Ward. I paid it online last week, the money was supposed to come out of my checking, and then I get a notice from my bank that it got returned. So what's the status? Is it paid or not? Because I'm not paying a late fee on something I already paid once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the account. [pause] Okay, I see the electronic payment was returned, so right now the balance is still open. There's no payment posted against it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Again. Great. That's the second time this has gotten messy and I did everything right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:54:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you want to make the payment again today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Hang on, my cousin from Providence is on the other line giving me advice, and she's loud. Cousin, I've got it! Sorry. Okay. Can I drop a payment in the box tonight? Does that count as on time if it goes in after you close?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a payment drop box at City Hall, and it's available outside office hours. Anything in it gets collected and processed the next business day, so I'd put it in with your account number written on the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so tonight in the box is fine. Good. And one more thing. My daughter helps me with the bills, she does the online stuff, and I want her authorized on the account so she can call and ask about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can do that. I'll need the request from you, the account holder, with her full name. I can note it now, and you'd need to confirm it in writing. I can email you the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just mail it, I'll fill it out. Her name is Gianna Iannuccilli, same last name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll send the form to the address on the account. Is the best callback number 401-555-0151?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:55:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Okay, thanks, Priya. Cousin says hi."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for calling. Take care."
    }
  ],
